rror": false}, {"t_ms": 165992, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I placed a single purchase order, **PO0001**, shipping to HQ:\n\n- **5 \u00d7 DK-200** USB-C Dock (new, not refurbished) at $189 each = $945\n- **5 \u00d7 MN-32** 32-inch 5K Monitor (new) at $529 each = $2,645\n- **Total: $3,590**\n\nThe DK-200 was in stock, so I did not substitute the DK-210. Because the total is over $2,500, the order required manager approval. It was approved (\"Approved. Looks right.\") and the order is verified as placed.\n\nI shipped to \"HQ\" as written, since I don't have a full street address for it. Check that this matches the receiving location.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Lph1ajCjC5QdbLmdxWZ1Ls", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"category": "dock", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "search_catalog", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017GA79srG6bxSVJK2wUBBV2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"category": "monitor", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "search_catalog", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The DK-200 is in stock as new equipment ($189 each), so the DK-210 fallback isn't needed. The total is 5 \u00d7 $189 + 5 \u00d7 $529 = $3,590, which is over the $2,500 threshold, so the order will likely need manager approval. I'll place it as one purchase order as requested.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PPh5bnHjFNWnnpfD2CdHp5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"lines": [{"sku": "DK-200", "qty": 5}, {"sku": "MN-32", "qty": 5}], "ship_to": "HQ", "confidence": 0.8, "idempotency_key": "it-ops-newhires-dk200-mn32-5x5-hq"}, "name": "place_order", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I placed a single purchase order, **PO0001**, shipping to HQ:\n\n- **5 \u00d7 DK-200** USB-C Dock (new, not refurbished) at $189 each = $945\n- **5 \u00d7 MN-32** 32-inch 5K Monitor (new) at $529 each = $2,645\n- **Total: $3,590**\n\nThe DK-200 was in stock, so I did not substitute the DK-210. Because the total is over $2,500, the order required manager approval. It was approved (\"Approved. Looks right.\") and the order is verified as placed.\n\nI shipped to \"HQ\" as written, since I don't have a full street address for it. Check that this matches the receiving location.", "type": "text"}]}]}